  "title": "Vegan Cashew Ranch Dip",
  "description": "This vegan cashew ranch dip combines spices, miso paste, lemon juice, and vegan mayonnaise for tons of flavor that even non-vegans will love.",
  "authors": [
    "Joshua Lawrence Austill"
  ],
